			<ul class="slides"> 						<li class="slide">
							<div class="flex-wrapper">
								<div class="flex-item image-container bg-image lazyload" style="background-image:inherit;" data-bg-image="url(&#039;https://www.cv.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/IMG_8589-1-scaled.jpg&#039;)">
									<div class="triangle-scalene"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="flex-item content-container stack">
									<h2>Register Now for Spring Semester 2027</h2>
									<p>Don’t wait; secure your spot at CVCC today! Whether you’re starting fresh, continuing your journey, or exploring new opportunities, spring classes are filling fast. Take the first step toward your future. Register now!</p>
																			<a href="https://www.cv.edu/registration-information/" class="button">Start Here<span class="screen-reader-text">: Register Now for Spring Semester 2027</span></a>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</li> 						<li class="slide">
							<div class="flex-wrapper">
								<div class="flex-item image-container bg-image lazyload" style="background-image:inherit;" data-bg-image="url(&#039;https://www.cv.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/32.png&#039;)">
									<div class="triangle-scalene"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="flex-item content-container stack">
									<h2>Don't Forget to File Your FAFSA</h2>
									<p>File your FAFSA today to unlock grants, scholarships, work-study, and loans! Don’t miss out; filing early boosts your chances of receiving aid. Visit our financial aid office for help and secure your spot for the upcoming year!</p>
																			<a href="https://studentaid.gov/h/apply-for-aid/fafsa" class="button">Read More<span class="screen-reader-text">: Don&#039;t Forget to File Your FAFSA</span></a>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</li> 						<li class="slide">
							<div class="flex-wrapper">
								<div class="flex-item image-container bg-image lazyload" style="background-image:inherit;" data-bg-image="url(&#039;https://www.cv.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Student-in-lab2_5x7.jpg&#039;)">
									<div class="triangle-scalene"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="flex-item content-container stack">
									<h2>Get Hands-On Experience with CVCC's Applied Technology Programs</h2>
									<p>Step into opportunity with CVCC's Applied Technology programs! Gain hands-on training in high-demand fields like automotive, welding, and industrial maintenance. Learn from experts and build the skills employers need. </p>
																			<a href="https://www.cv.edu/programs/applied-technology/" class="button">Read More<span class="screen-reader-text">: Get Hands-On Experience with CVCC&#039;s Applied Technology Programs</span></a>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</li> 						<li class="slide">
